    n "Joey watched in anticipation as the toast cooked. It popped up, with only one side cooked. The other was raw."
    j_d "What are you doin?"
    j "..."
    j_d "Look at you, eating like a rat. I told you I would make breakfast, right? You little theif!"
    j "...I was hungry."
    n "His Dad pushes him out the way, unplugging the toaster. He swings the window open, throwing the toaster-"
