    p_j_d "I'm fine goin' to solitary...{w=0.5}I'm fine getting more time...{w=0.5}"
    j_d "I just want my son to have hope...{w=0.5}Please give him hope!{w=0.5} He has none because of me!"
    j_d "Where's my son gonna go? {w=0.5}How is he gonna live? {w=0.5}How is he...{w=0.5}gonna die?"
    j_d "{w=0.5}...Lord, you let dogs like me can eat the crumbs from under your table!"
    j_d "My son's no dog, but...you can take care of him, now. Help him see how much he needs you."
    
    pause 0.5
    n "TO BE CONTINUED"
    
